<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective Oct 1.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     22.11     25.35	  5.25-10.48 3.68-8.86</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     22.11     25.35	  5.06-10.05 3.55-8.43</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     26.48     31.10	  11.99	9.68</p>
<p> White sugar	  26.48     31.30	  7.47	 5.16</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.31	  0.39	 0.34</p>
</text>
